{"ID":"20240205153756-5lysfp6","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153756-5lysfp6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153756-5lysfp6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104825-nf4glyv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619182539-monl9n1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619182539-monl9n1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"藿香","type":"doc","updated":"20240902173236"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240725155840-lxemfzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725155840-lxemfzq","updated":"20240725171916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"藿香"}]},{"ID":"20240725155848-k058qpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725155848-k058qpr","updated":"20240725155848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240725135225-sjtjdou.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725140055-toc7gnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725140055-toc7gnu","updated":"20240725152916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240725134159-8i4a1nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725134159-8i4a1nt","updated":"20240725140331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 392px;","style":"width: 382px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香-20240725134159-otu07yq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 382px;\" parent-style=\"width: 392px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 438px;","style":"width: 428px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 3-20240725140256-459bk35.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 428px;\" parent-style=\"width: 438px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 439px;","style":"width: 429px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 4-20240725140553-030shao.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 429px;\" parent-style=\"width: 439px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725161321-64yaxdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725161321-64yaxdr","updated":"20240725170039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 527px;","style":"width: 517px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"藿香 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/藿香 3-20240725160743-axur5tc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 517px;\" parent-style=\"width: 527px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 724px;","style":"width: 714px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"藿香 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/藿香 4-20240725170039-klneyft.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 714px;\" parent-style=\"width: 724px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725151945-hiujb1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725151945-hiujb1p","updated":"20240725152917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 655px;","style":"width: 645px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 8-20240725151945-dldg0f7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 645px;\" parent-style=\"width: 655px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 585px;","style":"width: 575px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 2-20240725140055-pa5r2pp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 575px;\" parent-style=\"width: 585px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725152912-4c7l9pc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725152912-4c7l9pc","updated":"20240725173653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 336px;","style":"width: 326px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"藿香 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/藿香 5-20240725173650-ins9nmp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 326px;\" parent-style=\"width: 336px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 448px;","style":"width: 438px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 11-20240725160025-bd94lwz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 438px;\" parent-style=\"width: 448px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 445px;","style":"width: 435px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"藿香 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/藿香 1-20240725152732-5py5a71.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 435px;\" parent-style=\"width: 445px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240725152548-cismw1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725152548-cismw1y","updated":"20240725152548"}},{"ID":"20240725152630-gcmbz3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725152630-gcmbz3l","updated":"20240725152630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"广藿香"}]},{"ID":"20240725152630-4ie02zb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725152630-4ie02zb","updated":"20240725152630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东广州、遂溪等地。\n【性状】\t该品茎略呈方柱形，多分枝，枝条稍曲折，长3060cm，直径约0.20.7cm；表面被柔毛；质脆，易折断，断面中部有髓；老茎类圆柱形，直径11.2cm，被灰褐色栓皮。叶对生，皱缩成团，展平后叶片呈卵形或椭圆形，长49cm，宽37cm；两面均被灰白色茸毛；先端短尖或钝圆，基部楔形或钝圆，边缘具大小不规则的钝齿；叶柄细，长25cm，被柔毛。气香特异，味微苦。\n【性味】\t辛，微温。\n【功效】\t芳香化湿；和胃止呕；祛暑解表。主湿阻中焦之脘腹痞闵；食欲不振；呕吐；泄泻；外感暑湿之寒热头痛；湿温初起的发热身困；胸闵恶心；鼻渊；手足癣 。"}]},{"ID":"20240725152630-8erz9tz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725152630-8erz9tz","updated":"20240725152630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206104832-6jyouwl.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725152630-7yedv78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725152630-7yedv78","updated":"20240725152630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香-20240205161138-e9916r4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725155111-r48od4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725155111-r48od4x","updated":"20240725170506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 425px;","style":"width: 415px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 10-20240725155724-zwwtd5c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 415px;\" parent-style=\"width: 425px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725153015-qmhfy03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725153015-qmhfy03","updated":"20240725160652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 540px;","style":"width: 530px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"藿香 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/藿香 2-20240725153015-2dogunk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 530px;\" parent-style=\"width: 540px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 540px;","style":"width: 530px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 12-20240725160652-ph1i5o4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 530px;\" parent-style=\"width: 540px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725144423-xjytwg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725144423-xjytwg1","updated":"20240725160703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 259px;","style":"width: 249px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 7-20240725151536-5qh7cwz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 249px;\" parent-style=\"width: 259px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 660px;","style":"width: 650px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 6-20240725144423-q68nomo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 650px;\" parent-style=\"width: 660px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 334px;","style":"width: 324px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 1-20240725135840-9r2doa0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 324px;\" parent-style=\"width: 334px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240725152242-husig86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725152242-husig86","updated":"20240725152242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 638px;","style":"width: 628px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香 9-20240725152242-l603bz4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 628px;\" parent-style=\"width: 638px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725160149-iniomx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725160149-iniomx5","updated":"20240725160149"}},{"ID":"20240725160149-etjsy9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725160149-etjsy9j","updated":"20240725160154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"广藿香、藿香对比"}]},{"ID":"20240725160416-zpyw3qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725160416-zpyw3qw","updated":"20240725160416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 408px;","style":"width: 398px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"广藿香、藿香对比 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/广藿香、藿香对比 1-20240725160416-52xklv3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 398px;\" parent-style=\"width: 408px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725150646-3s8t9ww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725150646-3s8t9ww","updated":"20240725152347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：藿香和广藿香不是一种植物，藿香正气液的用的藿香是广藿香；"}]},{"ID":"20240725155135-7tls3ec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725155135-7tls3ec","updated":"20240725155148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：广藿香很少开花，花期是4月；而藿香多开花，为顶生密集的圆筒形穗状花序，花期为9到11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240725141453-w7vsvld","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240725141453-w7vsvld"}},{"ID":"20240902173228-87w8uvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-87w8uvw","updated":"20240902173236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：藿香"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-j4bt5xx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-j4bt5xx","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"藿香《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-t8hx47z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-t8hx47z","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-oe5jc51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-oe5jc51","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HuòXiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-ptbbz4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-ptbbz4h","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为唇形科植物广藿香或藿香的全草。广藿香于6～7月间生长繁茂时采收，海南地区每年收2次，第1次在5～6月，第2次在9～10月，除去须根、泥土，晒2～3天，堆放，闷2天后再晒，再闷，如此堆晒至干为止。藿香第1次在6～7月开花时采收，第2次在10月。采后晒干或阴干。单用老茎者，药材名\"藿梗\"。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-vg2vu50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-vg2vu50","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-iwqnupe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-iwqnupe","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①广藿香，又名：枝香。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-gpu8q5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-gpu8q5r","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生草本，高30～100厘米；揉之有香气。茎直立，粗壮，四棱形，密被灰黄色长柔毛，上部多分枝。叶对生，阔卵形、卵形或卵状椭圆形，长5～10厘米，宽1.5～4厘米，下部的叶较小，先端钝尖，基部阔楔形或近心形，边缘具不整齐的钝锯齿，两面均密被灰白色短柔毛，沿叶脉处最多；叶柄长2～3厘米，密被灰黄色柔毛。轮伞花序密集成穗状，顶生或腋生，长2～8厘米，直径1～2厘米；萼5裂，萼筒长6～8毫米，较苞片为长：花冠唇形，淡紫红色，长约8毫米，裂片4（下唇3裂），近等长，先端钝，全缘；雄蕊4，突出，花丝有髯毛；子房上位，柱头2裂。小坚果椭圆形，平滑。花期1～2月。但很少开花。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-8cvle8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-8cvle8c","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"广东、云南有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-te8guwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-te8guwp","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②藿香，又名：排香草、野藿香。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-aw3fc4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-aw3fc4t","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年生或多年生草本，高40～110厘米。茎直立，四棱形，略带红色，稀被微柔毛及腺体。叶对生；椭圆状卵形或卵形，长2～8厘米，宽1～5厘米，先端锐尖或短渐尖，基部圆形或略带心形，边缘具不整齐的钝锯齿，齿圆形；上面无毛或近无毛，散生透明腺点，下面被短柔毛；叶柄长1～4厘米。轮伞花序聚成顶生的总状花序；苞片大，阔线形或披针形，被微柔毛；萼5裂，裂片三角形，具纵脉及腺点；花冠唇形，紫色或白色，长约8毫米，上唇四方形或卵形，先端微凹，下唇3裂，两侧裂片短，中间裂片扇形，边缘有波状细齿，花冠外被细柔毛；雄蕊4，2强，伸出花冠管外；子房4深裂，花柱着生于子房底部中央，伸出花外，柱头2裂。小坚果倒卵状三棱形。花期6～7月。果期10～11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-s79rzrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-s79rzrb","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生长于山坡或路旁，分布黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、河北、河南、山东、陕西、安徽、江苏、浙江、广东、福建、湖北、湖南、江西、四川、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-kdg5ec2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-kdg5ec2","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-v70px9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-v70px9w","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①广藿香"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-yoc54bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-yoc54bd","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥全草长30～60厘米，分枝对生。老茎略呈四方柱形，四角钝圆，直径约4～10毫米，表面灰棕色或灰绿色，毛茸较少，质坚不易折断，断面粗糙，黄绿色，中央有白色髓。嫩茎略呈方形，密被毛茸，质脆易断，断面灰绿色。叶片呈灰绿色或黄绿色，多皱缩或破碎，两面均密生毛茸，质柔而厚。气香，浓郁，昧微苦而辛。以茎粗、结实、断面发绿、叶厚柔软、香气浓厚者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-pocdze6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-pocdze6","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产广东。一般认为本种的品质较优。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-x5lasyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-x5lasyq","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②藿香"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-kotpdzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-kotpdzb","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：土藿香（《滇南本草》），杜藿香。干燥全草长约60～90厘米。茎呈四方柱形，四角有棱脊，直径约3～10毫米，表面黄绿色或灰黄色，毛茸稀少，或近于无毛；质轻脆，断面中央有白色髓。老茎坚硬，木质化，断面中空。叶多已脱落，剩余的叶灰绿色，皱缩或破碎，两面微具毛；薄而脆。有时枝端有圆柱形的花序，土棕色，小花具短柄，花冠多脱落，小坚果藏于萼内。气清香，味淡。以茎枝青绿、叶多、香浓者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-tludxac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-tludxac","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产四川、江苏、浙江、湖北、云南、辽宁等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-5tca8yr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-5tca8yr","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-kxim09h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-kxim09h","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"广藿香含挥发油约1.5％，油中主成分为广藿香醇，约占52～57％；其他成分有苯甲醛、丁香油酚、桂皮醛广藿香薁醇、广藿香吡啶、表愈创吡啶；另有多种其他倍半萜如石竹烯、β-榄香烯、别香橙烯、γ-广藿香烯、β-古芸烯、α-愈创木烯、瓦伦烯、α-古芸烯、γ-毕澄茄烯、δ-愈创木烯、α-广藿香烯、二氢白菖考烯等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-5ew3qwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-5ew3qwr","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"藿香含挥发油0.28％，主要成分为甲基胡椒酚，占80％以上。并含有茴香醚、茴香醛、d-柠檬烯，以及对-甲氧基桂皮醛、α-蒎烯、β-蒎烯、辛酮-3、辛醇-3、对-聚伞花素、辛烯-1-醇-3、芳樟醇、l-石竹烯、β-榄香烯、β-葎草烯、α-衣兰烯、β-金合欢烯、γ-毕澄茄烯、二氢白菖考烯等。我国东北产藿香风干材料，全草含挥发油0.54％，并含微量鞣质及苦味质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-n0peor0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-n0peor0","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-n1ki7f1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-n1ki7f1","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①抗真菌作用"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-7jysz9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-7jysz9m","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"试管实验藿香煎剂（8～15％）对许兰氏毛癣菌等多种致病性真菌有抑制作用；蕾香乙醚浸出液（3％）及醇浸出液（1％）亦能抑制多种致病性真菌，水浸出液的抗真菌效力与煎剂相似；趾间毛癣菌及足跖毛癣菌在煎剂15％对方出现抑制，而乙醚浸出液于3％、醇浸出液于5％及水浸出液于10％等浓度时均呈抑菌作用，因此藿香的浸出液比煎剂抗菌力强。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-pw1sv4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-pw1sv4g","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②抗螺旋休作用"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-v67cf1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-v67cf1x","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"藿香水煎剂（15毫克/毫升）对钩端螺旋体有抑制作用，但必须将浓度增至31毫克/毫升时，方能杀死钩端螺旋体。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-fy7l1kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-fy7l1kc","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③对胆囊的影响"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-ofm41tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-ofm41tw","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口服藿香煎剂，利用X线胆囊造影术，证明藿香对胆囊无收缩作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-itri0j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-itri0j3","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】藿香：拣去杂质，除去残根及老茎，先将叶摘下另放，茎用水润透，切段，晒干，然后与叶和匀。藿梗：取老茎，水浸润透，切片晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-f02cxo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-f02cxo2","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-xee7wzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-xee7wzs","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-p7rp0p0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-p7rp0p0","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《南方草木状》：\"味辛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-7hzghrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-7hzghrl","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-m3zjf2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-m3zjf2a","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《珍珠囊》：\"甘苦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-gdrgmhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-gdrgmhl","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-cm2d6hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-cm2d6hs","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肺、脾、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-9ego3mf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-9ego3mf","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《汤液本草》：\"入手，足太阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-sb4kn3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-sb4kn3g","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺、脾、胃三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-h2mhyps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-h2mhyps","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入心、肝、肺三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-nc3taa2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-nc3taa2","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-bvr87ij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-bvr87ij","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"快气，和中，辟秽，祛湿。治感冒暑湿，寒热，头痛，胸脘痞闷，呕吐泄泻，疟疾，痢疾，口臭。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-3y2njxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-3y2njxd","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"疗风水毒肿，去恶气，疗霍乱、心痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-donu4eu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-donu4eu","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草图经》：\"治脾胃吐逆，为最要之药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-5wqbzx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-5wqbzx1","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《珍珠囊》：\"补卫气，益胃气，进饮食，又治吐逆霍乱。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-ax9fuu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-ax9fuu0","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《汤液本草》：\"温中快气。肺虚有寒，上焦壅热，饮酒口臭，煎汤漱。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-8uilf60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-8uilf60","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草述》：\"散寒湿、暑湿、郁热、湿热。治外感寒邪，内伤饮食，或饮食伤冷湿滞，山岚瘴气，不伏水土，寒热作疟等症。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-2ey1me8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-2ey1me8","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草再新》：\"解表散邪，利湿除风，清热止渴。治呕吐霍乱，疟，痢，疮疥。梗：可治喉痹，化痰、止咳嗽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-istad39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-istad39","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；或入丸、散。外用：煎水含漱；或烧存性研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-mq2gr9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-mq2gr9j","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-pb16h5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-pb16h5y","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"阴虚火旺，胃弱欲呕及胃热作呕，中焦火盛热极，温病热病，阳明胃家邪实作呕作胀，法并禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-bshb1pz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-bshb1pz","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"其茎能耗气，用者审之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-egwgbh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-egwgbh3","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-terf5gd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-terf5gd","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治伤寒头疼，寒热，喘咳，心腹冷痛，反胃呕恶，气泻霍乱，脏腑虚鸣，山岚瘴疟，遍身虚肿，产前、后血气刺痛，小儿疳伤：大腹皮、白芷、紫苏、茯苓（去皮）各一两，半夏曲、白术、陈皮（去白）、厚朴（去粗皮，姜汁炙）、苦梗各二两，藿香（去土）三两，甘草（炙）二两半。上为细末，每服二钱，水一盏，姜三片，枣一枚，同煎至七分，热服。如欲出汗，衣被盖，再煎并服。（《局方》藿香正气散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-qhoxeuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-qhoxeuk","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治暑月吐泻：滑石（炒）二两，藿香二钱半，丁香五分。为末，每服一、二钱，淅米泔调服。（《禹讲师经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-8xy5wp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-8xy5wp9","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治霍乱吐泻：陈皮（去白）、藿香叶（去土）。上等分，每服五钱，水一盏半，煎至七分，温服，不拘时候。（《百一选方》回生散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-h1yqbl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-h1yqbl2","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疟：高良姜、藿香各半两。上为末，均分为四服，每服以水一碗，煎至一盏，温服，未定再服。（《鸡峰普济方》藿香散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-kxso8xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-kxso8xv","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤香口去臭：藿香洗净，煎汤，时时噙漱。（《摘元方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-9zi5irj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-9zi5irj","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治小儿牙疳溃烂出脓血，口臭，嘴肿：土藿香，入枯矾少许为末，搽牙根上。（《滇南本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-a6errb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-a6errb4","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治胎气不安，气不升降，呕吐酸水：香附、藿香、甘草各二钱。为末，每服二钱，入盐少许，沸汤调服之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-l1vx11q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-l1vx11q","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治冷露疮烂：藿香叶、细茶等分。烧灰，油调涂叶上贴之。（《包会应验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-wq438h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-wq438h6","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治刀伤流血：土藿香、龙骨，少许为末，外敷。（《滇南本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-vnmezh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-vnmezh9","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-trlh5ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-trlh5ke","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药品化义》：\"藿香，其气芳香，善行胃气，以此调中，治呕吐霍乱，以此快气，除秽恶痞闷。且香能和合五脏，若脾胃不和，用之助胃而进饮食，有醒脾开胃之功。辛能通利九窍，若岚瘴时疫用之，不使外邪内侵，有主持正气之力。凡诸气药，独此体轻性温，大能卫气，专养肺胃。但叶属阳，为发生之物，其性锐而香散，不宜多服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-k9u6bxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-k9u6bxh","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草正义》：\"藿香，清芬微温，善理中州湿浊痰涎，为醒脾快胃，振动清阳妙品。《别录》治风水毒肿者，祛除湿浊，自能清理水道也。去恶气者，湿漫中宫之浊气也。霍乱心腹痛者，湿浊阻滞，伤及脾土清阳之气，则猝然撩乱，而吐泻绞病，芳香能助中州消气，胜湿辟秽，故为暑湿时令要药。然性极和平，力量亦缓，止可以治霍乱轻症，而猝然大痛，吐泻并作，肢冷脉绝者，非大剂四逆不为功，断非此淡泊和平，所能独当大任。\"\"藿香芳香而不嫌其猛烈，温煦而不偏于燥热，能祛除阴霾湿邪，而助脾胃正气，为湿困脾阳，怠倦无力，饮食不甘，舌苔浊垢者最捷之药。亦辟秽恶，解时行疫气。盖疠疫以气染人，无非湿浊秽腐之熏蒸，感之者由口鼻吸入，胃先受之，芳香得清气之正，而藿香气味和平，不嫌辛燥，故助脾胃而无流弊。但必以广产为佳，虽以气胜，而冲和可爱，今江浙间遍地产之，则味苦涩而气亦恶劣。石顽谓伐胃消食，且能耗气，而世俗以为能解暮气，瀹茶多饮，未尽善也。\"\"仲醇谓阴虚火旺，胃弱欲呕及胃热作呕者弗用。按藿香虽不燥烈，然究是以气用事，惟舌有浊垢，而漾漾欲泛者最佳。若舌燥光滑，津液不布者，咸非所宜。凡芳香行气，醒脾胜湿诸芳草，皆有同情，不仅藿香、木香一类为然也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-2lhcc3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-2lhcc3s","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-th33yso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-th33yso","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"藿香《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-o6lj68r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-o6lj68r","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-aa0kn3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-aa0kn3f","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《名医别录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-s75c5zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-s75c5zp","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草图经》：藿香，岭南郡多有之，人家亦多种植。二月生苗，茎梗甚密，作丛。叶似桑而小薄。六月、七月采之，暴干，乃芳香，须黄色，然后可收。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-w31f5wq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-w31f5wq","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：藿香，方茎有节，中虚，叶微似茄叶。洁古、东垣惟用其叶，不用枝梗，今人并枝梗用之，因叶多伪故耳。《唐史》云，顿逊国出藿香，插校便生，叶如都梁者，是也。刘欣期《交州记》言藿香似苏合香看，谓其气相似，非谓形状也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-d3wubm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-d3wubm4","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HuòXiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-5zff1zc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-5zff1zc","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CablinPotchouliHerb，WrinkledGianthyssopHerb"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-f5y7lv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-f5y7lv5","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】土藿香、猫把、青茎薄荷、排香草、大叶薄荷、绿荷荷、川藿香、苏藿香、野藿香、猫尾巴香、猫巴虎、拉拉香、八蒿、鱼香、鸡苏、水麻叶"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-bxpsfb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-bxpsfb8","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-ikas8jf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-ikas8jf","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为唇形科植物藿香的地上部分。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-r6hhzcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-r6hhzcr","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Agadtacgerygisa(Fisch.etMey.)O.Kuntze."}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-qodxymq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-qodxymq","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：北方作一年生栽培，南方种后可连续收获2年，产量以第2年为高。6-7月，当花序抽出而未开花时，择晴天齐地割取全草，薄摊晒至日落后，收回堆叠过夜，次日再晒。第2次在10月收割，迅速晾干，晒干或烤干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-491spjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-491spjf","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】一年生或多年生草本，高40-110cm。茎直立，四棱形，略带红色，稀被微柔毛及腺体。叶对生；叶柄长1-4cm；叶片椭圆状卵形或卵形，长2-8cm，宽1-5cm，先端锐尖或短渐尖，基部圆形或略带心形，边缘具不整齐的钝锯齿，齿圆形；上面无毛或近无毛，散生透明腺点，下面被短柔毛。花序聚成顶生的总状花序；苞片大，条形或披针形，被微柔毛；萼5裂，裂片三角形，具纵脉及腺点；花冠唇形，紫色或白色，长约8mm，上唇四方形或卵形先端微凹，下唇3裂，两侧裂片短，中间裂片扇形，边缘有波状细齿，花冠外被细柔毛；雄蕊4，二强，伸出花冠管外；子房4深裂，花柱着生于子房底部中央，伸出花外，柱头2裂。小坚果倒卵状三棱形。花期6-7月，果期10-11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-yod7csc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-yod7csc","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-3uo6f7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-3uo6f7c","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山坡或路旁。多栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-eh0krpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-eh0krpc","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华东、西南及河北、陕西、河南、湖北、湖南、广东等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-1l7s3ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-1l7s3ac","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-5764tq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-5764tq3","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜温暖湿润气候，稍耐寒，在北京地区能在田间越冬。怕干旱。一般土壤均可栽培，但以排水良好的砂质土壤为好。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-rkj7hp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-rkj7hp8","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用种子繁殖。当种子大部分变成棕色时收获，置阴凉处后熟数日，晒干脱粒。南方气温较高，可采用秋播，9-10月按行株距各30cm开穴，深2-4cm，底平，施人畜粪水后，每1hm2用种子7.5kg。拌草木灰，匀播穴内，产量较高。北方3-4月播种，顺畦较行距25-33cm，开1-1.3cm的小浅沟，种子匀播于沟内，覆土2-4cm，用足蹊一遍每1hm2用种子7.5-12kg，产量较低。苗高6-10cm时间苗，条播按株距10-15cm留苗，穴播的每穴留苗3-4株。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-d8y86ex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-d8y86ex","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理生长期间及时松土除草。追肥以氮肥为主，苗高15cm时和收获后要各追施氮肥1次，另还需看苗追肥。要注意灌溉排水，保持田间一定的湿润。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-s5exrcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-s5exrcm","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治病害有褐斑病，在5、6月发生，可及时摘除病叶烧毁；实行轮作，发病前及发病初期喷1：1：100波尔多液。斑枯病防治可在冬季清除枯枝落叶烧毁，并喷洒50%瑞毒霉1000倍液防治。枯萎病可在雨后及时疏沟排水，隆低温度；发病初期，拔除病株，并用70%敌克松粉剂1000倍液或40%多菌灵胶悬液500倍浇灌病穴。虫害有朱砂红叶螨。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-5rucft4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-5rucft4","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-39e3esy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-39e3esy","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别地上产分长30-90cm，常对折或切断扎成束。茎方柱形，多分枝，直径0.2-1cm，四角有棱脊，四面平坦或凹入成宽沟状；表面暗绿色，有纵皱纹，稀有毛茸；节明显，常有叶柄脱落的疤痕，节间长3-10cm；老茎坚硬、质脆，易折断，断面白色，髓部中空。叶对生；叶片深绿色，多皱缩或破碎，完整者展平后呈卵形，长2-8cm，宽1-6cm，先端尖或短渐尖，基部圆形或心形，边缘有钝锯齿，上表面深绿色，下表浅绿色，两面微具毛茸。茎顶端有时有穗状轮伞花序，呈土棕色。气芳香，味淡而微凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-xfc4nj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-xfc4nj3","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以茎枝色绿、叶多、香气家者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-71z794z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-71z794z","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别茎表面观：表皮胞多角形，轴向延长。具气孔及毛茸，气孔直轴式。非腺毛多为1-4细胞；腺毛头部1-2细胞，柄单细胞；腺鳞偶见，头部多为8个细胞，柄单细胞。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-fy1qiia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-fy1qiia","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶表面观：表皮细胞垂财壁波状弯曲。气孔直轴式，主要分布在下表皮，上下表皮者具毛茸，以下表皮为多面手邮，上表皮非腺毛多为1-2细胞，长16-80μm，下表皮非腺毛多为1-4细胞，长70-460μm，毛茸圆锥形，表面有疣状突起，基部邻细胞3-4，呈放射状排列，角质层纹理较明显；腺毛头部1-2细胞，以单细胞较多见，柄单细胞；腺鳞头部8个细胞，扁圆球形，直径56-80μm，柄单细胞。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-lzbav4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-lzbav4f","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】挥发性成分：藿香含挥发油0.28%，主要成分为甲基胡椒酚（methylchavicol)占80%以上。并含有茴香脑（anethole)，茴香醛（anisaldehyde)，柠檬烯（limonene)，对甲氧基桂皮醛（P-methoxycinnamaldehyde)，α-和-β-蒎烯（pinene)，3-辛酮（3-octanone)，1-辛烯-3-醇（1-octen-3-ol)，芳樟醇（linalool)，1-丁香烯（1-carypholene)，β-榄香烯（β-elemene)，β-葎草烯（β-humu-lene)，α-衣兰烯（α-金合欢烯（β-farnesene)，γ-毕澄茄烯（γ-cadinene)，菖蒲烯（calamenene)；还含有顺式-β，γ-已烯醛（cis-β，γ-hexenal)[1]。黄酮类化合物：刺槐素（acacetin)，椴树素（tilianin)，蒙花甙（linarin)，藿香甙（agastachoside)，异藿香甙（isoagastachoside)，藿香精（agastachin)[2，3]。根含马斯里酸（mas-linicacid)即是山楂酸（crateglicacid)，齐墩果酸（oleanolicacid)，3-O-乙酰基齐墩果醛（3-O-acetyloleanolicaldehyde)，刺槐素，椴树素，藿香甙，胡萝卜甙（daucosterol)，β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol)，去氢藿香酚（dehydro-agastol)[4]，1-亚甲基-6，8-二羟基-5-甲氧基-7-（1，1-二甲基羟甲基）-1，2，3，4，9，10，10，a-七氢-9-菲酮[1-methylene-2，4a-dimethyl-6，8-dihydroxy-5-methoxy-7-(1，1-dimethyl-hydroxymethyl)-1，2，3，4，10，10a-heptahydro-9-phenanthroxe][5]。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-mvotz1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-mvotz1g","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-8vfht4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-8vfht4c","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.抗真菌抗菌作用：广藿香酮具有良好的抗真菌活性。广藿香鲜汁浓度≥75%时，虽抗菌范围不广，但能抑制金黄色葡萄球菌、白色葡萄球菌及枯旱杆菌的生长。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-itjpt4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-itjpt4n","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对实验性急性外耳道炎的治疗作用；广藿香鲜汁对含黄色葡萄球菌（S．Aureus）所致豚鼠急性外耳道炎（0.1ml菌混悬液，滴耳）的治疗作用，广藿香鲜汁，每次4滴，治疗耳侧平均4.1天恢复，不治疗耳侧平均7.l天痊愈，比较两侧恢复所需天数，差异显着（P\u003c0.05），表明广藿香对金黄色葡萄糖球菌所致豚鼠急性耳道炎有治疗效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-i4sr4xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-i4sr4xh","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对钙离子的拮抗作用：广藿香水提液中具有对钙离子的拮抗活性成分，其水提液对K+挛缩具有抑制活性。广藿香用于治疗消化不良、呕吐、腹泻和食欲不振，消化器官肌肉的过度收缩可能是呕吐和腹泻的部分原因，因此钙拮抗剂通过降低经细胞膜内的Ca2+流量来控制平滑肌的过度兴奋，从而达到减轻这些症状。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-jk1zhpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-jk1zhpg","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别（1）取本品粗粉2g，加石油醚20ml，置水浴回流30min，滤过。取滤液1ml，加1%香草醛盐酸试液0.5ml，上层石油醚层显黄绿色，放置后下层渐显紫褐色。（检查挥发油）（2）薄层色谱取本品粉末75g，置挥发油测定器中蒸出挥发油。取0.1ml挥发油加环已烷至1ml，作供试液。另取甲基黄苏丹Ⅲ制成对照液，吸取两深液点于硅胶G-CMC板上，用石油醚-乙酸乙酯（95：5）上行展开；取出，晾干，喷以5%茴香醛浓硫酸试液，于110℃加热3-5min，供试液色谱中与对照液色谱相应处显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-a4388l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-a4388l8","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】藿香：拣去杂质，除去残根及老茎，先将叶摘下另放，茎用水润透，切段，晒干，然后与叶和匀。藿梗：取老草，水浸润透，切片晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-sczz9n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-sczz9n3","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；性微温"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-35s3u5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-35s3u5l","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺；脾；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-yixf2cn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-yixf2cn","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛暑解表；化湿和胃。主夏令感冒；寒热头痛；胸脘痞闷；呕吐泄泻；妊娠呕吐；鼻渊；手；足癣"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-caam2oa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-caam2oa","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，6-10g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，煎水先；或研末搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-v9tbr8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-v9tbr8b","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-lgliumk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-lgliumk","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经疏》：阴虚火旺，胃弱欲呕及胃热作呕，中焦火盛热极，温病热病，阳明胃家邪实作呕作胀，法并禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-e074g4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-e074g4o","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经逢原》：其茎能耗气，用者审之。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-q6zonjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-q6zonjv","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】①治伤寒头疼，寒热，喘咳，心腹冷痛，反胃呕恶，气泻霍乱，脏腑虚鸣，山岚瘴疟，遍身虚肿，产前、后血气刺痛，小儿消伤：大腹皮、白芷、紫苏、茯苓(去皮)各—两，半夏曲、白术、陈皮(去白)、厚朴(去粗皮，姜汁炙)、苦梗各二两，藿香(去士)三两，甘草(炙)二两半。上为细末，每服二钱，水一盏，姜三片，枣一枚，同煎至七分，热服。如浓出汗，衣被益，再煎并服。(《局方》藿香正气散)②治暑月吐泻：滑石(炒)二两，藿香二钱半，丁香五分。为末，每服一、二钱，浙米泄调服。(《禹讲师经验方》)③治霍乱吐泻：陈皮(去白)、藿香叶(去士)。上等分，每服五钱，水一盏半，煎至七分，温服，不拘时候、(《百一选方》回生散)④治疟：高良姜、藿香各半两。上为末，均分为四服，每服以水一碗，煎至一盏，温服，未定再服。(《鸡峰普济方》藿香散)⑤香口去臭：藿香洗净，煎汤，时时噙漱。(《摘元方》)⑥治小儿牙疳溃烂出脓血，口臭，嘴肿：土藿香，入枯矾少许为末，搽牙根上。(《滇南本草》)⑦治胎气不安，气不升降，呕吐酸水：香附、藿香、甘草各二钱。为末，每服二钱，入盐少许，沸汤调服之。(《圣惠方》)⑧治冷露疮烂：藿香叶、细茶等分。烧灰，油调涂叶上贴之。(《包会应验方》)⑨治刀伤流血：土藿香、龙骨，少许为末，外敷。(《滇南本草》)"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-jm6zuzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-jm6zuzj","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-e01e3df","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-e01e3df","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《药品化义》：藿香，其气芳香，善行胃气，以此调中，治呕吐霍乱，以此快气，除秽恶痞闷。且香能和合五脏，若脾胃不和，用之肋胃而进饮食，有醒脾开胃之功。辛能通利九窍，若岚瘴时疫用之，不使外邪内侵，有主持正气之力。凡诸气药，独此体轻性温，大能卫气，专养肺胃。但叶属阳，为发生之物，其性锐而香散，不宜多服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-bnvcv9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-bnvcv9x","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草正义》：藿香，清分微温，善理中州湿浊痰涎，为醒脾快胃，振动消阳妙品。《别录》治风水毒肿者，祛除湿浊，自能清理水道也。去恶气者，湿漫中宫之浊气业、霍乱心腹痛者，湿浊阻滞，伤及脾士清阳之气，则猝然撩乱，而吐泻绞痛，芳香能助中州清气，胜湿辟秽，故为暑湿时令要药。然性极和平，力量亦缓，止可以治霍乱轻症，而猝然大痛，吐泻并作，肢冷脉绝者，非大剂四逆中为功，断非此淡泊和平，所能独当大任。藿香芳香而不嫌其猛烈，温煦而不偏于燥热，能怯除阴霾湿邪，而助脾胃正气，为湿困脾阳，怠倦无力，饮食不甘，舌苔浊垢者最捷之药。亦辟秽恶，解时行疫气。盖病疫以气染人，无非湿浊秽腐之烫熬，感之者囱口鼻吸入，胃先受之，芳香得清气之正，而藿香气味和平，不嫌宰燥，故助脾胃而无流弊。但必以广产为佳，虽以气胜，而冲和可爱，今江浙间遍地产之，则味苦涩而气亦恶劣。石顽谓伐胃消食，且能耗气，而世俗以为能解暑气，瀹茶多次，未尽善也。仲醇谓阴虚火旺，胃弱欲呕及胃热作呕者弗用。按藿香虽不燥烈，然究是以气用事，惟舌有浊垢，而漾漾欲泛者最佳。若舌燥光滑，津液不布者，咸非所宜。凡芳香行气，醒脾胜湿诸芳草，皆有同情，不仅藿香、木香一类为然也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-4st020d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-4st020d","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《别录》：疗风水毒肿，去恶气，疗霍乱、心痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-9yketee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-9yketee","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草图经》：治脾胃吐逆，为最要之药。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-64ki8xi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-64ki8xi","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《珍珠囊》：补卫气，益胃气，进饮食，又治吐逆霍乱。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-8fvk3hw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-8fvk3hw","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《汤液本草》：温中快气。肺虚有寒，上焦壅热，饮酒口臭，煎汤漱。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-vb2iqx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-vb2iqx1","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草述》：散寒湿、暑湿、郁热、湿热。洽外感寒那，内伤饮食，或饮食伤冷湿滞，山风瘴气，不伏水士，寒热作疟等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-kh9111q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-kh9111q","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草再新》：解表散邪，利湿除风，清热止渴。治呕吐霍乱，疟，痢，疮疥。梗：可治喉痹，化痰、止咳嗽"}]},{"ID":"20240902173228-ndj7ssw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173228-ndj7ssw","updated":"20240902173253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173229-it5jj1l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902173229-it5jj1l","updated":"20240902173253"}},{"ID":"20240902173230-3chaux5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173230-3chaux5","updated":"20240902173253"}}]}